      "message": "Could you tell me if there is a bug associated with this?\n\nThere shouldn\u0027t be an issue with LowPowerStandbyController receiving the screen-off state change first. Could you clarify which order you are seeing LowPowerStandbyController receive the events and why it is an issue?",
